            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "Design an innovative device for a connected classroom in a futuristic smart school using IoT solutions.\n\n- Drag the furniture, classroom items, and communication devices into the Canvas to the right to design. \n- Use the digital sticky notes to label what problem you are solving, what data you are collecting, how data is transmitted, and any security & safety concerns that might arise.",
